  "description": "This NuGet package includes the required files to create an ASP.NET and ASP.NET Core MVC web application with support for the document editor of TX Text Control DS Server. Integrating an MS Word inspired document editor helps your users to create professional documents and reporting templates with a unique WYSIWYG rendering and user experience. At least a trial version of TX Text Control DS Server is required to use this NuGet package.\n\nThis package version is meant for use with DS Server 4.0.0.",
